label: "ADR 0005: unconditional S3 multi-object deletion — typed outcomes, bounded chunks"
timestamp: "2026-08-23T22:27:03"
source: "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/path/docs/decisions/0005-batched-deletion.md"
